   "metadata": {
    "title": "He signs his will",
    "description": "In his will, written in his own hand, Washington provides that the people he owned are to be freed on **Martha**’s death, with the old and sick supported and the young taught to read and a trade. **William Lee** is freed at once, with an annuity. The dower people were not his to free.",
